Fix trust marks never being renewed: they were read from a static `trust_marks` property that an admin had to paste in by hand, and (e.g. for CIE, 24h validity) expired the day after onboarding with nothing in the logs to say so. `OIDCPlugin.get_current_trust_marks()` now refreshes them from the federation registry's `/resolve` endpoint (cached in memory for a few hours, falling back to the static property if the registry is unreachable) and logs a warning when a trust mark is close to or past expiry [mamico]
